{"title":"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Casework)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Casework)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many rearrangements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b7189fc05f58344dc86c4790cf960d504196f533.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abcd$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> are there in which no two adjacent letters are also adjacent letters in the alphabet?  For example, no such rearrangements could include either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/d/84d3d21d313eeb41fd6bd2d0212884e4703e2ac6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ba$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3ad07ba45d9a4dcd46fbd971320abb2585f7ce0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first thing one would want to do is place a possible letter that works and then stem off of it.  For example, if we start with an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we can only place a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> next to it.  Unfortunately, after that step, we can't do too much, since:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/b/97bbd2f79277568625f5969ae4fee4c0e94260c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$acbd$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is not allowed because of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df89f73c5de42c1c12b2792feb1bb38b836ce405.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cb$\" width=\"16\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c41e3abba19d247984a92930c074def7f27c927a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$acdb$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is not allowed because of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6e1a0789128066a6b03855158dafabb8d84f63b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cd$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p><p>We get the same problem if we start with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, since a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> will have to end up in the middle, causing it to be adjacent to an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>If we start with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, the next letter would have to be a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and since we can put an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> next to it and then a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> after that, this configuration works.  The same approach applies if we start with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>So the solution must be the two solutions that were allowed, one starting from a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and the other with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, giving us:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f41291c0414c639626de55d3be3727b6fa413201.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 + 1 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2}.\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Casework.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Casework)\">Solution 2 (Casework)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Casework)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b>Case 1: the first letter is A</b>\n</p><p><i>Subcase 1: the second letter is C</i>\n</p><p>The next letter must either be B or D, both of which do not satisfy the conditions.\n</p><p><i>Subcase 2: the second letter is D</i>\n</p><p>The third letter is forced to be B and the fourth is forced to be C, but this doesn't work because B and C are next to each other.\n</p><p><b>Case 2: the first letter is B</b>\n</p><p>The next letter is forced to be D, the third letter forced to be A and the last forced to be C. This works.\n</p><p><b>Case 3: the first letter is C</b>\n</p><p>The next letter is forced to be A, the third letter is D and the last letter is B. This works.\n</p><p><b>Case 4: the first letter is D</b>\n</p><p><i>Subcase 1: the second letter is A</i>\n</p><p>The third letter has to be C and the fourth has to be B but this doesn't work because B and C are next to each other.\n</p><p><i>Subcase 2: the second letter is B</i>\n</p><p>The third letter cannot be A or C, so this doesn't work.\n</p><p>Summing the cases, there are two that work: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/531e7128308b99ef0ea70212f84059203f1681f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BDAC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/a/c2a2246ef08c3b38ff7d9aec215e4789279c53c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CADB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/b/d6bdccbdce2320dd22e3746e5b8aab272bc6110b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Longrightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"91\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~JH. L\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be adjacent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must be adjacent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> must be adjacent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> must be adjacent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. In other words, the way the letters can be connected is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/c/99c684381ac7c78761c0d8fd8bc10e3463e51012.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c-a-d-b.\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"12\" /> Therefore, the only two possible arrangements are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/3219a3e82ad85354ab08ce44756146ed6b496e5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cadb$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/d/ebdaa29066d52c18efaecd7ce7eb3c540ee2cc8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bdac$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />, which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3adefec827068fcce8470f84eb8444d1848f285a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> cannot be in the middle because they would be forced to be next to at least one letter that is next to them in the alphabet(For example, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> was in the middle the only letter that can be next to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> but since it's in the middle it needs another letter, which means that it's not possible). Therefore you either have a case starting with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />(then it has to be followed by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />) or starting with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, amounting to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3adefec827068fcce8470f84eb8444d1848f285a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> cases\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/hTcv8lbvs6o\">https://youtu.be/hTcv8lbvs6o</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0W3VmFp55cM?t=1055\">https://youtu.be/0W3VmFp55cM?t=1055</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3MiGotKnC_U?t=1509\">https://youtu.be/3MiGotKnC_U?t=1509</a>\n</p><p>~ ThePuzzlr\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8sTQIX4YJ6s\">https://youtu.be/8sTQIX4YJ6s</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A\">2015 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_